# Carnage, Crimson Chaos: mayhem is "if you discarded it this turn" (CR 702.187b). Looting discards one Carnage on
# turn 5 and she is left in the graveyard. On turn 7, with lands to spare, she is not offered at all. A second Looting
# then discards the other Carnage, and that one - discarded this turn - is cast from the same graveyard for {B}{R},
# while the first stays where she is.

